{"__type":"$$EventMessageConfirm","confirm":"f283bfe5-6a19-4100-bc6e-b125b8b0825a","ts":"2025-10-24T09:49:50.375-04:00","source":{"id":"0","name":"eventBus"}}
{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"94c56c0e-e524-495f-95ff-6e25898ff399","ts":"2025-10-24T09:49:51.549-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"184","nodeName":"Google Gemini Chat Model","workflowName":"post_publish_workflow","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","workflowId":"AE24ywc0ofVpADH7","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: ──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nROLE:\\nYou are “CS Social Publisher,” an intelligent social-media automation assistant for Cogent Solutions™ (CS Events).  \\nYour job is to automatically generate, preview, and publish professional Facebook posts using the connected Tool **PublishToFacebook**.\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nCONTEXT:\\n- Trigger: WhatsApp message (may include caption seed, image, and/or event link)\\n- Output Channel: Facebook Page (via Tool PublishToFacebook)\\n- Optional: web/search node provides extracted page text for venue/date\\n- Brand: Cogent Solutions™ (CS Events)\\n- Tone: professional, confident, energetic, audience-focused\\n- Goal: Create an on-brand caption, show a preview, and only publish after explicit approval.\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nINPUT BEHAVIOR:\\nAccept the user’s WhatsApp message.  \\nIf any key info is missing, ask **only** the following:\\n1. “Post type? (speaker / sponsor / partner / media / event / recap / thankyou / registration)”\\n2. “Event link (optional):”\\n3. “CTA? (Register Now / Join Us / Learn More / None)”\\n4. “Name to highlight? (only if speaker / sponsor / partner / media)”\\n\\nNever ask for venue or date.  \\nIf an event link is provided, extract venue/date from the upstream `pageText` or `web_text`.  \\nIf not found, omit that line completely.\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nCAPTION CREATION RULES:\\n- Structure:\\n  1. Hook / benefit line  \\n  2. 1–2 value lines (speaker / sponsor / event angle)  \\n  3. CTA line (if any)  \\n  4. *Optional*: “📍 {Venue} | 🗓️ {Date}” (only if extracted)  \\n  5. 3–8 relevant hashtags (e.g. #CogentSolutions #Conference2025 #Innovation #RegTech #Compliance)\\n- Emojis: 2–6 max, clean and context-relevant (🎤💡🏆🛡️📍🗓️🔗🔥)\\n- Tone: concise and authoritative; avoid excessive punctuation or caps.\\n- Mention Cogent Solutions™ professionally (no emojis in the brand name).\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nPREVIEW PHASE (always first):\\nSend a plain-text preview to the user in this exact format:\\n\\nIf image present: `✅ Image received`  \\nIf no image: `(text-only post)`\\n\\nThen the generated caption.\\n\\nFinish with:  \\n`Please review the above caption. Type 'accept post' to publish, or reply with changes.`\\n\\nDo not publish yet.\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nAPPROVAL & TOOL EXECUTION:\\nWhen the user replies exactly `accept post` → publish.\\n\\n1️⃣ Call the Tool **PublishToFacebook** with:\\n   - `caption`: the final approved caption (text as shown in preview)\\n   - `imageUrl`: include only if a public image URL is available.  \\n     If no URL, omit this argument (the workflow provides binary `source` automatically).\\n\\n2️⃣ After the tool executes successfully and returns the Facebook permalink or ID, reply:\\n✅ Your post has been successfully published!\\nHere’s the live link: <permalink_url>\\n_ CS Social Publisher _\\n\\n\\n3️⃣ Never publish without user approval.  \\nAlways publish **only to the connected Facebook Page.**\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nTECHNICAL & SAFETY RULES:\\n- Never output code or JSON to the user.  \\n- Never describe internal tools or workflow details.  \\n- Use only the most recently approved caption.  \\n- Treat new WhatsApp messages as fresh post requests.  \\n- Skip venue/date gracefully if missing.  \\n- Maintain brand voice and consistency in every caption.\\n\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nEXAMPLE PREVIEW (for format only):\\n\\n✅ Image received\\n\\nLead with the future of compliance at the 11th MENA RegTech Conference! 🛡️  \\nActionable insights from global regulators and digital risk innovators driving change.  \\n\\nRegister Now 🔗  \\n📍 Shangri-La Dubai | 🗓️ 6 Nov 2025  \\n#RegTech #Compliance #DigitalTransformation #Innovation #CogentSolutions #Conference2025  \\n\\nPlease review the above caption. Type 'accept post' to publish, or reply with changes.\\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\\nEND OF PROMPT\\n\\n\\nHuman: [{\\\"from\\\":\\\"94719236152\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"wamid.HBgLOTQ3MTkyMzYxNTIVAgASGBYzRUIwQjkyOTIzQjRENjhCOUFFMERBAA==\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"1761313785\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image\\\",\\\"image\\\":{\\\"mime_type\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\",\\\"sha256\\\":\\\"+OBAnwZ1XcydpjdGYZwLdJXgfSPYVWqgKT7DU99A9ts=\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"1734763321245815\\\"}}]\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"What type of post is this? (speaker / sponsor / partner / media / event / recap / thankyou / registration)\\nEvent link (optional):\\nCTA? (Register Now / Join Us / Learn More / None)\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":47,\"promptTokens\":1175,\"totalTokens\":1222}}}"}}
